[% if kind == 'web' %]
| `src/` | The app: `main.tsx`, `routes.tsx` (route table), `pages/`, `config.ts` |
| `index.html`, `public/` | Page shell; static files (`config.json`: run-time defaults) |
| `docker/nginx.conf` | The server (T); `docker/nginx-site.conf` is yours |
[% else %]
| `src/` | The package: `index.ts` (public API)[% if has_cli %], `config.ts`, `cli.ts` (commander)[% endif %][% if kind == 'service' %], `api.ts` (Fastify)[% endif %] |
[% endif %]
| `tests/unit/`, `tests/integration/` | vitest; integration is opt-in (`RUN_INTEGRATION=1`) |
